  "question": {
    "text": "A fish looking up through the water sees the outside world contained in a circular horizon. If the refractive index of water is $4 / 3$ and the fish is $12 \\mathrm{~cm}$ below the surface, the radius of this circle in $\\mathrm{cm}$ is"
  },
  "options": [
